<title>USA: Kevco to acquire Bowen supply.</title>
<headline>Kevco to acquire Bowen supply.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kevco Inc Thursday said it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire Bowen Supply Inc, a privately held distributor of building products.</p>
<p>The acquisition, valued at $19.5 million, is expected to be completed within the next 30 days.</p>
<p>Kevco said it expects the acquisition of Bowen to add about $40 million to sales on an annual basis.</p>
</text>
